  "term": "POMS",
  "definition": "POMS is a widely used multidimensional self-report questionnaire for measuring mood states, especially their temporary and changing nature. It is used in settings such as psychotherapy, medicine, and sport psychology, and has been applied and validated across multiple languages and cultures.",
